### PayVerse — admin-service through the gateway. adminToken = a login with a mobile in ADMIN_MOBILES,
### supportToken = one in SUPPORT_MOBILES (01-auth.http). Maker-checker needs two different people.

### Find a user by mobile, or by name / KYC tier
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/users?mobile={{payeeMobile}}
Authorization: Bearer {{supportToken}}

> {% if (response.body.length > 0) client.global.set("adminUserId", response.body[0].userId); %}

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/users?name=asha&kycTier=MIN_KYC
Authorization: Bearer {{supportToken}}

### Freeze / unfreeze the wallet (ADMIN)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/wallets/{{adminUserId}}/freeze
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Suspicious activity reported by the user" }

###
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/wallets/{{adminUserId}}/unfreeze
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### A user disputes one of their transfers (user token)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/disputes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "transactionId": "{{transactionId}}", "reason": "I paid the wrong person" }

> {% client.global.set("disputeId", response.body.id); %}

### Support picks it up and resolves with a refund (support = maker)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/disputes/{{disputeId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{supportToken}}

###
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/disputes/{{disputeId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{supportToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "outcome": "REFUND", "note": "Payee confirmed the mistake" }

> {% client.global.set("refundId", response.body.refundId); %}

### An ADMIN approves (checker) — the transfer is reversed
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/refunds/{{refundId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Refund requests waiting for a checker
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/refunds?status=REQUESTED
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Audit trail of a dispute
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/audit-logs?entityId={{disputeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Rotate the JWT signing key (ADMIN)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/security/signing-keys/rotate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
